# Generated 2026-10-30
# Base: seleron/vitabrowser (patch stack through 331)
#
# isolation (CSS Compositing 1) was not a property, so `isolation:
# isolate` was dropped (cssgaps: claude, github, oldreddit). Tailwind's
# `isolate` class is how a button keeps its `-z-[1]` fill span above the
# card it sits on (patch 332-netsurf).
#
#  - CSS_PROP_ISOLATION 0x0ab, enum css_isolation_e (inherit/auto/
#    isolate), propstrings "isolation" (after transition-delay, LAST_PROP
#    moves) and keyword "isolate" (after the deprecated colours).
#  - parse: p_isolation.c (auto | isolate | inherit). select:
#    s_isolation.c, not inherited, initial auto. The computed value is 2
#    bits at bits[15] 28-29, free between hanging_punctuation and
#    justify_items. css_computed_isolation() reads it.
